{
  "work_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii",
  "source_path": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii.json",
  "source_language": "chu",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-29",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.72v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "90acd733768a4018",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The prayer of Saint Pionius, which was found in another writing. In these books it is read in the Roman language."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.72v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "13091d827ac7c63d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Pionius himself confessed that he was a Christian, and it was decided that he should be burned alive."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.72v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "b3aede5ae21a6e3d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When the blessed man went to the place where the fire had been kindled and saw the burning flame,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.72v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "4bc02d25102465d1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "he begged the soldiers leading him to grant him a little time to offer a prayer."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.72v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "fa7bf7c78ac65bcc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He bent his knees and raised his hands, with others supporting him, for he himself,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.73r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "c56e943a28a1f469",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "because he had been suspended for so long, could not raise his arms on his own. He began to pray to the Lord and say:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.73r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "589e4176ba2db565",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Glory to you, Jesus Christ, the only-begotten Son of God, who are forever with him, the Word of God,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.73r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "ad9e8f49b98d2285",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the living power who gives life to all things, the treasury of the Father's knowledge, the good root of the new [?] garden,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.73r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "f3aa1de7e5ce518f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "which is an unfailing hope for our bearing fruit for God, for us who have come to know the Father and the Holy Spirit through you;"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.73r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "be24c53f7d2cfca4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "a crown for the Father's glory, [?] of different lights for our confession,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.73r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "4452a923ebd399e1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "woven as a sweet fragrance for the Father; the mystery hidden for ages"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.73r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "482b2bc2602f962e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and now revealed for our sake, to those who confess your dominion;"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.73r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "69f86074e269b112",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the steward of all creation, who holds the heavenly rudder, which is the Holy Spirit,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.73r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "b2e4c8e0e3a13a10",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and delivers every soul tossed about in the devil's bitterness;"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.73r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "9308f15ebfe2cd97",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the good worker who separates the chaff from the wheat through the Holy Spirit; the heavenly bread,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.73r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "fb39fb2181912a6d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "strengthening the hearts of those who know your good deeds;"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.73r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "b8bd0ca668a4e36e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the good wine of the new vineyard, gladdening and brightening the faces of those who await your coming;"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.73r.s13",
      "source_sha256": "02338a856fff34f3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the source of the life-giving Spirit, the Father's inseparable right hand, the living image of the Father's likeness;"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.73r.s14",
      "source_sha256": "8bce3a3c2f2bf8fd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "a peaceful haven for those who sail, hope for the hopeless, the holiness of God's grace, the righteous"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.73v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "436c63d466c8881b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "judge, the giver of rewards to those who confess you before others, the way leading to the Father;"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.73v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "583c33e368c0be34",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the door through which to enter the Father's presence, the good shepherd who laid down his life for the sheep and delivered me, a sinner, from the wolf;"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.73v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "df0830a8be99576c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "present everywhere that anyone calls upon you; the true kingdom, rest for the burdened;"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.73v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "2dba9a5b81520864",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the healer of those whose souls are sick, who forgives sins by divine authority; the crown of martyrs;"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.73v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "c2223ff8e71fba28",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the true God, who is God over all, with the Son and the holy and life-giving [?],"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.73v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "887ff7be36b30868",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and inseparable from the glory of God and of your Holy Spirit, living in you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.73v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "76cd36c692441e85",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 6,
      "text": "and filling everything in heaven and on earth and in the sea with your coming."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.73v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "e164beaee855ff4f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 6,
      "text": "and governing and giving food to all flesh. To you belong praise, glory, majesty, and holiness,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.73v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "8a5e1dd7736fcc8f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 6,
      "text": "to the Father and the Holy Spirit forever. Amen. And having said this in the hearing of everyone, he made the sign of Christ,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.73v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "3587db5ab1959df2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 6,
      "text": "entered the fire, opened his mouth, and surrendered his soul. And the holy martyr of God died in Smyrna."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.73v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "69531b5bbc25f914",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 6,
      "text": "Now I, Blaise, was in Ephesus at that time, and having been released from the emperor’s service,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/oratio-pionii#Supr.73v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "260cf47edea2ae72",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 6,
      "text": "I copied this, translating it from the Roman language into Greek."
    }
  ]
}
